cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Licence is mixed: see
  LICENSE.md. The columns this project adds are CC BY 4.0; the source columns
  (descriptions and published codes) remain under each source's licence.
type: dataset
title: "FoodEx2 reference set"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
abstract: >-
  Open reference set of food descriptions from published food datasets, with
  reviewed FoodEx2 codes, for benchmarking and testing automatic FoodEx2
  coding. The columns this project adds (codes, reviews, notes) are CC BY
  4.0; food descriptions and the codes sources published remain under each
  source's licence as recorded in LICENSE.md.
authors:
  - given-names: Jorn
    family-names: Mineur
    affiliation: "FoodNotes (e-accent BV)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FoodNotes-org/foodex2-reference-set"
keywords:
  - FoodEx2
  - EFSA
  - food classification
  - food composition
  - benchmark
